WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.620
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.970
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.690
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.900
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.860
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:55.820
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.480 --> 00:01:36.740
My name is Kurata Sana,
first year middle school student!

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:39.910
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.660
My best friend who I met in the
bathroom, Fuka.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.080
The amazing white bat, Babbit.

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.250
Best to stay under a warm table in cold Japan.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:51.420
Together abroad New York for
theatrical studies, Naozumi-kun.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:53.710
Now my important business partner.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:56.590
Hayama Akito,
my pal through thick and thin.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.800
Supposedly. He's now dating Fuka.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:04.520
You're a devil. A devil forever
till the time of your death.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.310
This... is my line?

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.070
It hurts... it hurts!

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.070
Tsuyoshi-kun? What did you say
about Fuka? What about Hayama?

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:20.990
All is Clear
When You Cannot See

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.160
Excuse me, Fuka!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:30.420
No, Ma-ma-Matsui Fuka...
Where is she?

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:35.460
Hayama! Where's Fuka?

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:38.220
Right now... undergoing surgery.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:41.430
Surgery? Where?

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:46.390
Her cornea... But they say it can
definitely be cured.

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.850
But it'll take a little time.

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:50.060
That's good.

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.560
No, it's not!

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:56.480
It's my fault. I was next to her
but I couldn't protect her.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.280
Hayama.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.450
Matsui-san's surgery is over.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.910
Fuka! Fuka! Are you alright?

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:15.420
You... You're still here?!
It's your fault!

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:18.510
Because of you, Fuka... Fuka is...

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.930
Dear! Let's go.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.980
Anyway, don't come see Fuka any
more, get it?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.650
It's my fault.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.190
My...

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:40.610
No! It's not your fault!
You didn't do anything wrong!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.070
Drop it.

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:43.910
Hayama.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.410
I think Fuka is
also worried about you.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:51.870
I'll tell her that you're worried.
Trust me, I will!

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:56.710
Hayama...

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:04.760
Hayama's image appeared so tiny...

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.850
and so fragile.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:10.180
Come in please.

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.850
It's Kurata Sana-chan! Welcome.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:16.110
Thank you for coming, Sana-chan.

00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.940
Sana, you came to see me?

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.240
Fuka, are you okay?

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.240
Yeah.

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:27.990
The doctor says it takes ten days
before the bandage can be taken off.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.700
During this time, she has to stay
in the hospital.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:34.080
We're relieved because they say it
won't damage her vision.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.750
Don't you two need to take care of
some hospitalization procedures?

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:43.300
- That's right.
- We'll go right away.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:45.890
Sana-chan, take your time.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.050
Okay... thanks.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:52.980
They seem so kind, and they have
good personalities, too.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.730
But why with Hayama...

00:04:56.060 --> 00:05:00.110
That's because... someone's been
setting things up!

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.190
That person looks like this.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.650
Sana.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:08.830
Have a seat. Are there any chairs,
by the way?

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.580
Yeah, there is.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.000
Really, are you all right?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.040
It's not a big deal,
so no problem.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:20.090
It hurt a lot at the time I was
injured, a total black out all of a sudden.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.630
I was really frightened.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.300
Sana, what about you?
Are you alright?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:28.680
Your job. Isn't your schedule
really tight?

00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:33.100
No problem, no problem.
I finished all my work.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.810
I'm glad.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:37.060
No worries! No worries!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.110
What's wrong? You sound weird.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:40.440
Is that so?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:45.400
No worries! No worries! No worries!
No worries!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:47.910
Calm down, please.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.200
Shh! Don't be so noisy.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:52.660
Sorry about that.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.250
About Hayama...

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.590
He's very worried about you.

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:10.260
Really.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.810
He's concerned and eager to see
you, but...

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:16.020
My parents?

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.060
Yeah.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:18.390
I see.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:24.860
Akito really didn't do anything
wrong, why did it turn out like this...

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:28.570
Hayama always gets blamed.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.620
He acts stubborn and insensitive,

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.700
so people get him wrong.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.920
Yeah... doesn't make sense why
it's like this.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:47.800
That's good, Fuka-chan's injury
isn't serious.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:49.050
Yeah.

00:06:49.050 --> 00:06:52.050
Sana-chan, you also need to
keep up your spirits.

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.850
Good luck on tomorrow's drama.

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:56.810
You had a day off to visit Fuka-chan

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:58.850
and deal with the problem
with your line.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:00.770
Reminding me of unpleasant things...

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.980
If you keep it up, things will
get bad.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.690
No problem! Piece of cake!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.320
It's all up to you.
Tomorrow we start with scene six...

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.780
Hayama...

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:15.410
I wonder what you're doing?

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.810
So quiet...

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:44.810
...about what time is it?

00:07:44.940 --> 00:07:49.440
Nine? Ten? Or already midnight?

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.780
I can't take this.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.370
With my eyes covered
I can't watch TV.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.830
Akito... what's he doing now?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.960
But... I need to practice.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:18.140
Akito... he doesn't think about
kissing me.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.730
He only thinks I want to date.

00:08:22.690 --> 00:08:24.270
Actually...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:27.900
She seems to have a good time with
Naozumi-kun.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.030
Let's not see each other for
a while.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.030
I want to concentrate on preparing
for my test.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.370
The black belt.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:40.450
I think I know that...

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.380
Akito is still in love
with Sana...

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:52.470
Though he tries to hide it,

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.090
I can sense it.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.760
No, I don't know!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:59.010
I don't want it that way!

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.770
What should I do?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.320
Good morning!

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:16.450
Oh! This one might be good.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.370
Sana-chan,
what are you writing?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:21.830
Ahh! I want to see it!
Lemme see!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.790
Well, about this...

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.460
You're trying to hide it,
can it be a love letter?

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.170
Morning.

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:33.460
Ah! Good morning!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:37.550
You seem spirited, scene six
should go fairly smooth, huh?

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.300
Well, I want to talk to you about
scene six.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:43.720
That line "You are a devil!"
I still can't say it.

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.890
So I thought of many alternatives.

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:49.940
I've mentioned Octopus head, Wordy
mouth yesterday...

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:54.650
And... Rice ball head, Idiotic Goose,
Scared Cat, Cucumber Squash, Water Bottle...

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.780
But my favorite one is
Honey Chestnut.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:01.530
- Honey... chestnut...?
- That's right.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:05.580
There's A and MA and KU plus RI
for free!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:08.080
You can think of the chestnut
being a freebie.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.250
That's not the problem!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.250
But that's not the problem!

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:14.920
You're a honey chestnut! Be a honey
chestnut till the time of your death!

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:17.130
Or you can add...
Tenshin Honey Chestnuts!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:19.140
Tenshin Honey Chestnuts are so delicious!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:22.810
Ten! My God! Very delicious!
Tenshin Honey...

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:24.970
What are you saying?

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:32.570
That devil line is the most
important line in the story!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:35.190
It took me hours
to have thought of that!

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.610
But you...

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:40.160
To have an opinion upon the famous
Mizoguchi-sensei's script,

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.660
it's not child's play.

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:42.740
I'm sorry.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:46.330
Tendon, udon, oyakodon...

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.500
Everyone,
what would you like for lunch?

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:53.340
May I ask what happened?

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:55.380
Don't ask at a time like this!

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.920
Can't you ever show up
at the right time?

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.840
Manager disqualification!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:03.800
Starting Scene Six

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.050
Starting Scene Six!

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:04.310
So tense...

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:07.520
I'll have to do it no matter what!
Alright!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.060
Sana-chan, hang on... good luck!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.400
Standby, ready, start!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:18.990
Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:24.200
Shut up!
You don't understand how I feel!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:28.330
You're... you're...

00:11:51.600 --> 00:12:02.610
{parte b}

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:03.660
Interruption!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.620
Get out your paper and crayons and let's start Sana-chan's drawing lesson!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:10.700
First you draw one mountain...,
then comes the water... *splash*...

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.790
...there goes 2 cups...

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.830
and add two ears.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.880
...butterfly, butterfly...
fly over here...

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.880
...ah you've also grown a tail on
your butt...

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.010
Left stroke, right stroke

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:23.090
...draw the arrow shaped eye...

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:25.090
and then another arrow for the
other eye...

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:29.180
...then add two of the wooden
horses stacked right on top of one another...

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:33.350
Hey ...plus 6 round eyes...

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.520
...and there it is,
Sana-chan's done!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:37.560
Dance! Dance! Hey, hey, hey!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:40.860
This is a portrait of Sana-chan!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:46.320
Cut! Cut!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.490
What the heck?

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:52.540
There is no crying in that scene!
Just ruins the whole story!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.580
I... I...

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:57.170
It's alright.
Hang on, Sana-chan.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.670
I'm sorry.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.920
What? What should I do?
The tears won't stop...

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.470
Sana-chan...?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.220
Sorry! Let me sort out my mind
for a little!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.180
No way! Sana-chan!

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.270
Wait, Sana-chan!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.850
You can't go.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:15.520
Riho-san.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:19.190
You can't go. She won't stop
because of this.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:27.530
Sana-chan,
what's happened to you?

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:30.910
I can't say it...
I still can't do it.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.120
I want to say it in my mind,

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:36.120
but my feelings... in my heart...

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:39.130
Devil! You're the devil!

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.670
If I say devil...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.090
I'll say it for the rest of
my life.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:46.550
Then, what would
Hayama think of me?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:49.430
He'll be hurt.

00:13:51.640 --> 00:13:54.100
I can't say it! I just can't!

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:56.100
Sana-chan...

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.980
Oy! Sana-chan! Hurry back to the
studio or you'll be in trouble!

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.190
She can't hear you
speaking like that!

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:08.740
But I can't say it to her when
she's like this!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:09.660
That's true.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:15.580
Who does she think she is?!
I absolutely hate those actresses.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:19.170
She thinks she's better cause she
just came back from America.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:23.000
I've written so many scripts and I
was never shamed like that!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.840
If we don't think of something
fast, we can't move on.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.090
Riho-san!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.340
I can't leave Sana-chan like that!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.590
Naozumi,

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.180
come here for a bit.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:41.400
Naozumi-kun.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.980
Naozumi,

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.570
do you really want to go find
Sana-chan that much?

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:49.820
Riho... san...

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.200
You can go.

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:58.620
But... you shall once again return
to the shadows.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.170
Shadows?

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.960
That's right, shadows.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:05.210
The shadow underneath
Sana-chan's brilliance.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:08.470
Always standing by Sana-chan,
becoming her support.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.470
It's a shadow
without its true self.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:15.310
I know very well that you like
Sana-chan.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:22.900
But if you like her, shouldn't you
try to stand at the same level she's at?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:32.410
When I first met you, I thought,
'lt's this child... '

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:36.580
That's right, I saw the brilliance
emanating from you.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.000
The only reason I returned to
Japan,

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.920
was to train you into
a true actor.

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:48.010
And because of that, I entered
this production company for you.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:49.630
For me...?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.840
That's right, for you.

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.550
Think about it!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:58.600
What's the most important thing for you and your future?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.060
Ah! I don't know!

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:04.980
No matter how I think about it,
I still haven't a clue of what I should do!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:07.730
Ah, Sana-chan,
I don't know either!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.820
People in deep thought.

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.780
If we don't
go back to the studio...

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:15.660
This is bad, bad, very bad!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.740
Then... this is no time for a song!

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.620
Calm down, Rei-kun.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:24.830
There must be a reason why
Sana-chan is so troubled!

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:29.420
As a responsible manager,
what should I do?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.220
Wait, I know!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.260
One hour?

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:39.100
Yes, just give me an hour and I promise I'll bring Sana-chan here to you.

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.640
That's not necessary.

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.480
Ah?

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:44.140
We want her to quit.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.150
What? Quit?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:48.980
How to do, Rei-kun?

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.940
Manager disqualification!

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.400
What? Sana-chan was forced to resign?

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:55.860
How can this be?

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.660
This week's Sana-chan.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:04.410
It's a little gloomy...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:08.290
Did you hear about Hayama?

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.000
Where he fought at an arcade...?

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.010
His girlfriend was seriously
injured.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.630
I can't believe it!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.970
And they were voted
best couple in Teen Net!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.970
They look so good together,
how can that be?

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:19.930
Hayama-kun...

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.100
You are in big trouble.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:26.190
And it's during the principal's
absence.

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:29.190
You don't have anything to say,
right, Hayama?

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:33.570
It's the truth that Matsui got
hurt because of you.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:37.610
Well, Head Counselor,
please make your decision.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:40.580
No way, suspension?!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:44.830
That's not fair,
it's the other's fault!

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.040
Ah, Akito-kun!

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.500
Wait a sec, Akito-kun!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:54.010
Akito-kun! It's not fair that
the school suspended you!

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:57.220
The fight was started by them!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.100
I'll go explain to the head
counselor!

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.720
Don't stick your nose in.

00:18:03.390 --> 00:18:05.020
Troublesome.

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.100
But... but Akito-kun...

00:18:07.100 --> 00:18:09.860
I'm glad that I can take ten days off.

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:13.190
And I can enter the karate
advancement test.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.940
How can you...?

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.110
Bye.

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:17.990
A... Akito-kun!

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.120
Akito-kun...

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:21.830
No.

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:23.240
Why?

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.120
We can't give you
an advancement test.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.250
I did fight,
but I didn't use karate!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.080
I can't do anything about it.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:36.630
When you get suspended, you lose the privilege. Though I do believe you but...

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.090
Sorry about this.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.560
Hey, that hurt!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.110
No good, this guy...

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.650
Run!

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:11.290
I'm home.

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:12.830
Oh, welcome home.

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:18.300
I went to see
Matsui-san today.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:21.510
But... they would not let me in.

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.180
Sorry.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.640
Don't mind it.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:28.140
Let's eat these together.

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:35.770
I heard comedy actress Sakura-chan will whiten her teeth for the New Year.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.280
Well, all celebrities love to have
white teeth!

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:41.530
Before we announce
the list of actors,

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:44.280
let me report this week's
shocking news.

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:47.830
This week's shocking news is about
Kurata Sana-chan.

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:51.670
Heard that she was fired from the
soap opera that she was in.

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.960
That is really surprising!
Why is that? Why?

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:57.460
She said, I can't say this line.
Then she ran out of the studio.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:01.170
Gosh!
Is the line that hard to say?

00:20:01.170 --> 00:20:03.720
No, no, not at all. It's a fairly
simple one.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:05.640
It's, 'You are a devil! '

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.680
De... vil?

00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:12.190
Will she quit?

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:15.690
She thinks too much because she
went to America and was popular there!

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.030
Devil?

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:27.530
He was called a devil by his
sister and had to go through a lot of struggle.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.370
Is that it...?

00:20:31.910 --> 00:20:37.380
Sana is still... with Akito?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:39.090
Is that it?

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:42.670
Who is it?

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.640
It's me.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.310
Akito?

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.980
I've come to visit.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:55.480
Visit? That was the window!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.940
Yeah...

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:02.030
Can't do anything about you.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:07.490
I apologize, my parents said
really mean words.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.660
That's why you came
through the window.

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.240
Because I caused it.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.080
How should I say this?

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.670
It's my fault. Sorry.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:21.340
Don't apologize.
It isn't your fault.

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.920
I'll definitely get better.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:28.600
If something happens next time,
I will definitely protect you!

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:38.610
I've... got a question to ask.

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:39.940
Yeah?

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:43.780
Did you come to visit me because you felt responsible?

00:21:43.780 --> 00:21:47.450
Or because you're my boyfriend?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:56.370
Let's...

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.590
